Z||000000||MooCow||11-26-2001||09:02 PM||||Well as it says I have found a trace of a mouse in my car.  Since I am still unalbe to drive my car it has just been siting next to the house and I went to start it up and opened the hood and seen mouse tracings.  So what is the best way to get rid of it?? Also how can I stop this from happening again??<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/forum_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||8
